OL,3,AMet chief says he wouldn't be surprised
OL,4,Aif more allegations made about Brand
OL,5,Aafter rape conviction
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe head of the Metropolitan Police has
OL,8,Fsaid he "wouldn't be surprised" if more
OL,9,Fpeople came forward to make allegations
OL,10,Fabout Russell Brand.
OL,12,FSir Mark Rowley also told BBC Radio 4's
OL,13,FToday programme that what he heard
OL,14,Freported from Brand's trial at
OL,15,FSouthwark Crown Court came very close
OL,16,Fto "victim blaming".
OL,18,FOn Thursday, the entertainer and
OL,19,Fcomedian was found guilty of one count
OL,20,Fof rape and three counts of sexual
OL,21,Fassault.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
